OL,3,GNEWSAProtest hotel to end asylum seeker
OL,4,Aaccommodation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel which was the scene of a
OL,7,Fviolent anti-immigration protest in
OL,8,F2024 is set to stop housing asylum
OL,9,Fseekers, the government has confirmed.
OL,11,FMore than 200 people gathered at the
OL,12,FPotters International Hotel in
OL,13,FAldershot, Hampshire, in July 2024.
OL,14,FEight people - including a 13-year-old
OL,15,Fgirl - were sentenced for their role in
OL,16,Fdisturbances that followed.
OL,18,FThe incident was part of the rioting
OL,19,Fthat swept across England in the days
OL,20,Fafter the fatal stabbing of three young
OL,21,Fgirls in Southport.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
