OL,3,GNEWSAProtest hotel to end asylum seeker
OL,4,Aaccommodation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is among eight asylum hotels across
OL,7,Fthe UK which will stop housing asylum
OL,8,Fseekers, which the government said was
OL,9,Fdue to a "significant drop" in small
OL,10,Fboat arrivals and speedier asylum
OL,11,Fdecision making.
